# Architecture & Implementation Plan - Secure File Vault

## System Architecture & Security Overview

The **Secure File Vault** is a zero-trust, security-first private cloud storage application. The system operates on a server-side **Envelope Encryption** architecture where plaintext file payload never touches permanent disk or object storage.

### System Topology

```
                  ┌───────────────────────────────────────────┐
                  │            Client Browser (React)          │
                  └─────────────────────┬─────────────────────┘
                                        │ HTTPS + Secure Cookie
                                        ▼
                  ┌───────────────────────────────────────────┐
                  │       Reverse Proxy (Caddy / Nginx)       │
                  │   TLS Termination, Security Headers, CSP   │
                  └─────────────────────┬─────────────────────┘
                                        │ HTTP Proxy (Internal Network)
                                        ▼
                  ┌───────────────────────────────────────────┐
                  │          Fastify Node.js 24 Backend       │
                  │ ┌───────────────────────────────────────┐ │
                  │ │  Security Layer: CSRF, CORS, RateLimit │ │
                  │ ├───────────────────────────────────────┤ │
                  │ │ Auth, MFA (Argon2id, TOTP, Sessions)  │ │
                  │ ├───────────────────────────────────────┤ │
                  │ │ Validation, Quarantine & Magic Bytes │ │
                  │ ├───────────────────────────────────────┤ │
                  │ │ Envelope Crypto (libsodium XChaCha20) │ │
                  │ └───────────────────┬───────────────────┘ │
                  └──────────────┬──────┴─────────────┬────────┘
                                 │                    │
                  SQL Metadata   │                    │ Encrypted Ciphertext
                                 ▼                    ▼
                    ┌──────────────────┐    ┌──────────────────┐
                    │ PostgreSQL 18.x  │    │  MinIO Object    │
                    │  DB Metadata &   │    │  Storage Server  │
