## Threat Model (STRIDE) & ASVS Mapping

| Threat Category (STRIDE) | Vulnerability / Risk | Mitigation Strategy | OWASP ASVS 5.0 Requirement |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Spoofing** | Credential stuffing, Session hijacking | Argon2id, TOTP MFA, Cryptographic session tokens, HttpOnly/SameSite Strict cookies | V2.1, V3.1, V3.2 |
| **Tampering** | Parameter manipulation, File modification | Server-side authorization check (Strict User ID binding), XChaCha20-Poly1305 AEAD integrity check | V4.1, V5.1 |
| **Repudiation** | Denied actions (file deletion, share) | Append-only security audit log (`audit_logs`) tracking IP, UA, timestamp & event type | V10.1, V10.2 |
| **Information Disclosure** | IDOR/BOLA, MinIO leak, Key exposure | Random UUID IDs, Envelope encryption (MinIO contains ciphertext only), No keys in logs | V8.1, V9.1 |
| **Denial of Service** | Upload payload explosion, Auth brute force | `@fastify/rate-limit`, strict body limit (100MB per file), DB Connection pooling | V13.1 |
| **Elevation of Privilege** | Path traversal, Executable upload | Filename sanitization, Magic byte sniffing, UUID object paths, Server-enforced ACLs | V12.1, V12.2 |

